{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892170/extras/e1bfa87c35c160a672c7f9f4f45ff342.avif?t=1768440013\" width=340 height=174 /></span><br><br>In the future, a technological revolution has brought intelligent robots that now threaten history itself. Your mission: protect the past, present, and future from this robotic menace.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892170/extras/32aa3a58600f3595bc402e07dd530765.poster.avif?t=1768440013\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892170/extras/32aa3a58600f3595bc402e07dd530765.webm?t=1768440013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>In <strong>House of Cards: TD</strong>, travel through time and battle robots attempting to alter history. Command historical figures in an innovative tower defense game that blends strategy, character fusion, and luck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit and Strengthen</h2><br>Strategically position historical heroes and use character fusion to enhance their abilities. Unlock new characters to expand your defensive options.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892170/extras/fa5c0db7924fdaa436f03f364ef6afa1.poster.avif?t=1768440013\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892170/extras/fa5c0db7924fdaa436f03f364ef6afa1.webm?t=1768440013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Innovative Gameplay:</strong> Combines tower defense strategy, character fusion, and luck elements.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Historical Figures:</strong> Includes Imhotep, Ramses II, Socrates, Leonidas, and more.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Temporal Challenges:</strong> Defend different eras against robotic foes.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Special Abilities:</strong> Unlock and upgrade unique skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Pixel Art Style:</strong> 2D top-down graphics with a pixelated aesthetic.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Character Fusion:</strong> Combine identical characters to strengthen them.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Variety of Enemies:</strong> Face common robots and challenging bosses.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Character Unlocking:</strong> Use a gacha system to acquire new heroes.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Progression:</strong> Advance through eras, collect gems, and unlock new characters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Rewards:</strong> Complete missions and discover secret characters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Available for Windows:</strong> Play on your PC and enjoy all features.</li></ul><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892170/extras/be925577617b14bb50a84c604153b436.poster.avif?t=1768440013\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892170/extras/be925577617b14bb50a84c604153b436.webm?t=1768440013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Objectives and Goals:</strong> Uncover the entire storyline and protect eras from robotic interference.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Gaming Experience:</strong> Exciting and addictive, with new challenges and discoveries in every phase.</li></ul><br><strong>House Of Cards: TD</strong> is in early access. J